@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title Handling abnormal transaction adjustment requests (Admin)

|Admin|
start
:Receive a handling request\n(from Finance/Counter/Student);
:Select the transaction to review;

|Internal Wallet System|
:Display transaction details\n(amount, time, channel, status);

|Admin|
:Verify supporting documents/related records;
if (Insufficient evidence?) then (Yes)
  :Reject the request;\nState the reason clearly;
  stop
endif

if (Transaction is completed\nand changes are not allowed?) then (Yes)
  :Switch to another process\n(refund/investigation);
  stop
endif

:Choose handling option\n- Increase/decrease wallet balance\n- Refund the amount\n- Add monitoring notes;
:Enter reason + approver (if required);
:Confirm;

|Internal Wallet System|
:Apply the adjustment based on the selected option;
:Store handling history and attached evidence;
:Return result;

|Admin|
:Notify the requester of the result;
stop
@enduml
